      "name": "Gagandeep",
      "created_at": "2025-09-23T08:02:06.078Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I want to implement ERPNext for a custom photobook business with the following workflow:</p>\n<p>Customers can order photobooks with variable pages (e.g., 10–60 pages), and the required raw materials (photo sheets, cover, box) change dynamically per order.</p>\n<p>Each photobook goes through multiple production steps such as image correction, PDF preparation, printing, binding, and delivery, with the possibility to add more steps in the future.</p>\n<p>I need to manage stock for raw materials accurately, create sales orders, track multiple jobs per order, and generate invoices after the photobook or the entire order is completed.</p>",
